[00:16.62] It's just a look, and it makes the boys quiver
[00:22.58] Yes, it's the look, and now they remember
[00:31.20] Had they forgotten... what this all means?
[00:37.58] I think they want to forget
[00:41.18] And they hope that this time
[00:46.96] (Chorus)
[00:46.96] I won't look, I've got other things to do now
[00:53.78] I forgot what it was, I've got to get to work now
[01:00.62] (And they) set an example for us (I see it!)
[01:05.24] It can happen to me too
[01:07.82] (And it) didn't make any difference to us (But I)
[01:12.08] Forgot the trouble, that's the trouble
[01:15.94] Forgot the trouble, that's the trouble
[01:20.06] Forgot the trouble, that's the trouble
[01:23.38] Forgot the trouble, that's the trouble
[01:24.24] With our love,
[01:27.56] With our love,
[01:31.22] With our love
[01:31.66] They hear the words, such as "You're really special"
[01:34.06] (And they) can't face that feeling
[02:02.88] (And they) can't really tell
[02:06.06] I look out the window
[02:09.46] (And I) I call that education
[02:13.26] (And I) see all my friends standing out there
[02:17.60] (And I) I call that education (sophistication)
[02:22.20] (Repeat chorus)
[02:23.46] Had they forgotten... what this all means?
[02:26.44] Things come and go (and I see 'em)
[02:26.46] And I won't be neglected (not this time!)
[03:21.02] (Repeat chorus)
